DISCLAIMER FOR HEALTHCARE APPLICATIONS:

This model is provided for educational and research purposes only. It is NOT 
intended for clinical use or as a replacement for professional medical diagnosis.

The model outputs should be used as a screening tool to support healthcare 
professionals in risk assessment, with final clinical decisions made only by 
qualified healthcare providers.

Users are responsible for:
- Validating model performance on their specific data
- Ensuring compliance with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, GDPR, etc.)
- Obtaining appropriate clinical validation before deployment
- Implementing proper audit trails and monitoring

Neither the authors nor contributors accept liability for clinical outcomes 
resulting from the use of this model.
